{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BURN. SURVIVE. CALL THE CROWS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, on a field where there's plenty of food for your crows but guarded by the Scarecrows. Crows are scared of scarecrows. To hijack the field of food for your crows, you must <strong>set fire to every single one that haunts and protect the fields from you</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaeGAME MODES</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/GameModeEnglish.png?t=1747269871\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>EVERYTHING BURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, fire is your weapon. The corn, the scarecrows, almost\u00a0<strong>everything burns</strong>. But be warned: the flames may reveal what hides in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/CornBurn.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>HUNTED BY SCARECROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scarecrows lurk within the corn field, hunting anything that dares disturb them. The more you burn, the more they awaken. These are not lifeless dummies, they <strong>watch</strong> you. They <strong>hunt</strong> you.\u00a0Your only hope? Fire. They won\u2019t stop until the fire consumes them\u2026 or you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/ScarecrowChase.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc26\u200d\u2b1b\u00a0<strong>CALL THE CROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your crows fear the scarecrows, but once the fields are clear, they will descend to feast. Every scarecrow burned is another step toward victory\u2014but can you burn them all before the nightmare claims you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/Crows.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3d<strong>NEVER IN THE SAME PLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area is <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, leading you deeper into the ever-changing nightmare. No two runs are the same,\u00a0<strong>no escape is guaranteed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/Maze.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>CAN YOU BURN YOUR WAY OUT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fields call for fire. The crows' hunger. And the scarecrows\u2026 <strong>they are waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>--&gt;\u00a0 CALLER OF THE CROWS\u00a0 &lt;--</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502860?t=1747269871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502860?t=1747269871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/66cebb7f2b27b3902fd04e5b6a3db0253e4a699e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747269871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/66cebb7f2b27b3902fd04e5b6a3db0253e4a699e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747269871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3633370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BURN. SURVIVE. CALL THE CROWS\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, on a field where there's plenty of food for your crows but guarded by the Scarecrows. Crows are scared of scarecrows. To hijack the field of food for your crows, you must <strong>set fire to every single one that haunts and protect the fields from you</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaeGAME MODES</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/GameModeEnglish.png?t=1747269871\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>EVERYTHING BURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Caller of the Crows</strong>, fire is your weapon. The corn, the scarecrows, almost\u00a0<strong>everything burns</strong>. But be warned: the flames may reveal what hides in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/CornBurn.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>HUNTED BY SCARECROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scarecrows lurk within the corn field, hunting anything that dares disturb them. The more you burn, the more they awaken. These are not lifeless dummies, they <strong>watch</strong> you. They <strong>hunt</strong> you.\u00a0Your only hope? Fire. They won\u2019t stop until the fire consumes them\u2026 or you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/ScarecrowChase.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc26\u200d\u2b1b\u00a0<strong>CALL THE CROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your crows fear the scarecrows, but once the fields are clear, they will descend to feast. Every scarecrow burned is another step toward victory\u2014but can you burn them all before the nightmare claims you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/Crows.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3d<strong>NEVER IN THE SAME PLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area is <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, leading you deeper into the ever-changing nightmare. No two runs are the same,\u00a0<strong>no escape is guaranteed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/extras/Maze.gif?t=1747269871\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>CAN YOU BURN YOUR WAY OUT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fields call for fire. The crows' hunger. And the scarecrows\u2026 <strong>they are waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>--&gt;\u00a0 CALLER OF THE CROWS\u00a0 &lt;--</strong></h2>","developers":["Nepxel Studio","Bibek Pandey"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502860/acbea645d110f005d02dc9fe03c3a0a6418caf6e/header.jpg?t=1747269871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120537,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120537/movie480.mp4?t=1743480398","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120537/movie_max.mp4?t=1743480398"},"name":"Caller of the Crows - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120537/a314b54146